-- 810(3.2) Before making an order under subsection (3), the justice or the summary conviction court shall consider whether it is desirable ... to add either or both of the following conditions ... (a) a condition prohibiting the defendant from being at ... a place ...; or (b) a condition prohibiting the defendant from communicating ...
