`s 810.01(5) the judge is to add the firearms condition if it is desirable` MEANS
    PARTY `a provincial court judge`
    MUST `s 810.01(5) add the firearms condition and specify the period`

-- 810.01(5.1) If the provincial court judge adds a condition described in subsection (5) to a recognizance, the judge shall specify in the recognizance how the things ... shall be surrendered, disposed of, detained, stored or dealt with and how the authorizations, licences and registration certificates ... shall be surrendered.
