    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "If the judge decides that it is desirable to do so"

-- 810.011(8) If the provincial court judge adds a condition described in subsection (7) to a recognizance, the judge shall specify in the recognizance how the things ... shall be surrendered, disposed of, detained, stored or dealt with and how the authorizations, licences and registration certificates ... shall be surrendered.
